{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011ChK5q5J9fYh43Z6KXMxdN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The signup button no longer overflows on phones. I changed `styles.css` only; I didn't render the page, so this is verified by reading the CSS, not in a browser.\n\nThe cause was `.cta` having a fixed `width: 420px` and `white-space: nowrap`. At 375px the card has about 343px of usable width, so the button ran past the edge and its long label couldn't wrap.\n\nThe changes to `.cta`:\n- **`width: 100%` with `max-width: 420px`**: the button fills the available width on small screens and keeps its original size on wider ones.\n- **`box-sizing: border-box`**: padding and border are counted inside the width, so the 2px border and 24px side padding don't push it past 100%.\n- **`white-space: nowrap` replaced with `overflow-wrap: anywhere`**: the label can now wrap onto two lines instead of forcing the button wider.\n\nThe project isn't a git repository, so there's no diff to show; the edited file is `styles.css`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":950,"cache_read_input_tokens":23992,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":950},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"da8702ce-45fe-4c42-b2e1-c62dd4d1f45f","uuid":"6bfc4c83-2ecc-466e-8063-e53748f673c9","timestamp":"2026-11-23T02:38:23.453Z","request_id":"req_011ChK5q56VTVVZHkZfhXdrR"}
